{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8c6d6006945d280a516","chatId":"1263040786a54860b1bacf7be8ed163c","sessionId":null,"userId":68744,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":902,"promptTokens":1578,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:14"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608279344342668,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8c6d6006945d280a515","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369734486,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:14","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8c6d6006945d280a515","chatId":"1263040786a54860b1bacf7be8ed163c","sessionId":null,"userId":68744,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n对哈维来说，今天是忙碌的一天。他起床晚了，去上班，没有吃早饭，被经理训斥，不得不加班，并且只吃了一餐。当他回家时，他想立刻上床休息，这时他看到了他父母早上发来的短信，那条短信他直到现在都没有机会查看，祝他生日快乐并留下了深情的祝福。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，哈维最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 伤心 & 生气\nB) 伤心 & 悔恨\nC) 伤心 & 失望\nD) 伤心 & 感激\nE) 失望 & 生气\nF) 气恼 & 悔恨\n\n## 问题 2\n哈维为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 哈维只吃了一顿饭 & 哈维回家后立即就想睡觉\nB) 他的父母忘记了他的生日 & 他的老板祝他生日快乐\nC) 他的父母祝他生日快乐，度过美好的一天 & 哈维回家后立即就想睡觉\nD) 今天是糟糕的一天，他只想把这一天结束 & 他的父母祝他生日快乐，度过美好的一天\nE) 他的父母忘记了他的生日 & 他跳过早餐可以减肥\nF) 今天是糟糕的一天，他只想把这一天结束 & 他跳过早餐可以减肥","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608279344342668,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8c6d6006945d280a516","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369734483,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:14","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"43365cea055c4b7f97b3ceb720418e92"}